                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاهَ بِهِ</span></b> 
                         (Msb) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَّهَ</span></b>  (S, Mgh, Msb, K)
<i>He rendered famous</i> (S, Mgh, Msb, K *) and
<i>magnified;</i> (Msb;) and <i>rendered notorious;</i>
(Mgh;) <i>it,</i> (S, Msb,) namely a person's name,
(S,) or a thing, (Msb,) or <i>him.</i> (Mgh.)

